KG42.register("clusters-c400409de747f43dbcc49abe",{"id":"06-sdr_energy_sharing::v142-d-CL001","paper":"06-sdr_energy_sharing","label":"Photovoltaic prosumer participation, dual roles, and prerequisites for demand response","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL001","label":"Photovoltaic prosumer participation, dual roles, and prerequisites for demand response","market_meaning":"Photovoltaic prosumers with the stated equipment configuration may participate in the sharing area and assume energy-supply or energy-consumption roles on an equal footing; participation in demand response for sharing is additionally subject to the assumption that they have a certain amount of shiftable load.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"Both chains describe photovoltaic prosumers in the same microgrid. The consumption role falls within the prosumers' range of roles; the shiftable-load assumption applies only to participation in demand response and cannot be extended into a universal eligibility threshold for all participation activities.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"The boundary comprises participants, role permissions, and prerequisites for participation in demand response. R004 supplements the consumption side of R005's dual-role statement and is not counted separately as an independent admission rule. This cluster assembles only qualitative participation conditions and does not claim to include a load scheduling model or comprehensive engineering admission checks.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R005","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the equipment configuration, participation on equal terms, and the load prerequisite for demand response, which constitute the main content of the participation rules."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Retains the statement of the same prosumer's consumption role, supplementing the scope of roles without adding another category of independent participation eligibility."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e27"],"rationale":"The quoted passage describes supplying and consuming energy as roles that the same prosumer can assume; the consumption-side statement and the dual-role statement have complementary scopes. The two types of participation nodes and the two constraints differ in scope and are not merged as the same object."}],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-G001","category":"ontology_extension","description":"Shiftable load currently appears only as a participation assumption. v141-b-g01-P1 and v141-b-g03-P01 remain unapproved, and participation-role nodes cannot be interpreted as already having a complete decision-making function for load shifting. The C2 candidate not adopted in R005 cannot supply this function either.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R005"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R005::V::participation.prosumer","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E-37","v141-b-g01-e19","v141-b-g03-E20"],"proposal_ids":["v141-b-g01-P1","v141-b-g03-P01"],"required_work":"If an extension to demand-response action rules is required, the relevant proposals should first be processed manually, after which the scheduling objects and their scope of applicability should be specified upstream; the current qualitative participation candidate remains unchanged."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G002","category":"unverified_source","description":"All evidence supporting this cluster is unverified evidence in the current B catalog and is eligible only as candidate support within this experiment. assembled means only that the qualitative participation content has formed a candidate within the stated scope.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004","v141-c-R005"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e04","v141-b-g01-e27","v141-b-g02-E-37"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the quoted passages, participation conditions, and scope of roles; no B source audit, independent C2 review, or Agent E review was conducted in this round."}]},"rule_refs":["06-sdr_energy_sharing::v141-c-R005","06-sdr_energy_sharing::v141-c-R004"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-f66e9ec7493cbb66","KG31-1200d592ea9a790f"]});
